jobs.description:
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Senior Product Manager - Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lille or Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; Omnicommerce &amp;amp; Customer — Loyalty &amp;amp; Account Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;About Decathlon &amp;amp; The Omnicommerce Domain&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Decathlon is accelerating its digital transformation with the mission of becoming the sports digital platform that allows customers to discover our universe through local, sport-centered, and omnichannel experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;By joining this scope, you will work within the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;48&quot;&gt;Omnicommerce &amp;amp; Customer&lt;/strong&gt; Unit. Our mission is to leverage cutting-edge technology to build trusted, seamless, and deeply personalized relationships at scale. We design the platforms that connect our members to the entire Decathlon ecosystem—online, on mobile, and in our physical stores worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Join the Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount Squad&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Membership Group Product Manager, you will take end-to-end ownership of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;114&quot;&gt;Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount&lt;/strong&gt; Product Team across our 3 front platforms: Responsive Web, iOS, and Android.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;You will lead a multi-disciplinary team alongside a dedicated Engineering Manager, Software Engineers (Web, iOS, Android), Product Designers, Data Analysts, and Product Marketing Managers (PMM), while partnering closely with central sports teams and local Country Loyalty leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Empowering enduring customer relationships through a frictionless, rewarding, and deeply personalized omnichannel membership journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Transition our membership product from a historical &quot;Run&quot; maintenance state into a high-tempo value delivery engine. You will drive identified omnichannel transactions, member lifetime value, and profile enrichment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define Vision &amp;amp; Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and drive the end-to-end product vision, strategy, and outcome-based roadmap for Membership and MyAccount across Web, iOS, and Android.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Accelerate Transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the operational shift from run-mode maintenance to a high-velocity feature delivery model, turning the membership space into a core business growth lever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&quot;Build vs. Buy&quot; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Bridge central business objectives with local country requirements, establishing a unified global membership experience while accommodating local market nuances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Experimentation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Continuous Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover high-impact member friction points through quantitative analytics, regular user interviews, usability testing, and benchmark studies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;UX/UI Simplification:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Design and Research to streamline complex account features, rewards catalogs, and loyalty point visibility into intuitive, engaging cross-platform interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experimentation Framework:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish continuous A/B testing and multivariate testing processes to validate hypotheses on member engagement, opt-in mechanics, and reward redemption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Alignment&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Agile Product Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer sprint cycles and backlog prioritization in tight synergy with the Engineering Lead, Mobile Engineers, and Web Developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Backlog Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Write precise Epics, User Stories, and robust acceptance criteria; anticipate cross-squad dependencies and ensure smooth release management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Journey Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Core E-Commerce teams (Cart, Checkout, PDP) and In-Store Cashtill teams to seamlessly embed member identification, instant rewards, and profile perks across all purchasing journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Go-to-Market Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Synchronize feature releases with Product Marketing Managers (PMM) and local digital teams, orchestrating simultaneous rollouts across Web and App Stores (iOS / Android).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define &amp;amp; Monitor KPIs:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and steer North Star and operational metrics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Identification:&lt;/em&gt; Total Active Members, Profile Completion Rate (PCR), and Omnichannel Identified Transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Loyalty Economics:&lt;/em&gt; Points Issued vs. Redeemed, Burn Rate, Member Lifetime Value (LTV), and Reward Engagement Rate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data-Driven Arbitrations:&lt;/strong&gt; Ground roadmap prioritization in rigorous analytics, sunsetting obsolete features and scaling initiatives with proven incremental business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;Product Mindset &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;24,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Excellence &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the global ambassador for membership and account experience standards across Decathlon&#39;s international tech and business communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;24,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster an autonomous, high-trust engineering culture grounded in psychological safety, shared accountability, and customer obsession.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of Product Management experience leading consumer-facing (B2C) digital products, customer portals, account spaces, or loyalty ecosystems at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Multi-Platform Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record in orchestrating feature delivery across both &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;90&quot;&gt;Responsive Web and Native Mobile Apps (iOS &amp;amp; Android)&lt;/strong&gt;, with solid understanding of mobile app release cycles and store guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Domain &amp;amp; E-Commerce Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of omnichannel e-commerce dynamics, conversion funnel optimization, customer retention mechanics, and loyalty economics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; Complete mastery of modern discovery and delivery frameworks (Dual-Track Agile, Scrum/Kanban, customer interview techniques, A/B testing, Build vs. Buy assessments).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional interpersonal skills with demonstrated success navigating complex, multi-stakeholder international matrix organizations (aligning global tech teams, central business units, and local country leaders).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly analytical and fluent in using analytics platforms to derive customer insights and back product decisions with hard data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English (written and spoken) with concise communication and synthesis skills; French is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; Excited by scalable customer-facing architecture, seamless digital-to-physical omnichannel journeys, and driven by a strong passion for sports !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Remote Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid model with 2 days of remote work per week (flexible).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based at our Decathlon Digital hubs in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;54&quot;&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;63&quot;&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt;, France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choice of Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Mac or Windows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; High-visibility leadership role at the core of Decathlon&#39;s customer strategy, offering structured mentorship, continuous upskilling, and international mobility paths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Financial Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive remuneration package including employee shareholding options (&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;96&quot;&gt;actionnariat salarié&lt;/em&gt;), as well as monthly and quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion and Accessibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: which is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people from all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to offering an inclusive and accessible selection process to all candidates. Should you require any accommodations, you can request them via the application form, and your request will remain confidential. These requests do not affect the outcome of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll develop and deliver a scale customer onboarding experience for a high volume of customers in our commercial segments. You&#39;ll work closely with leadership to help design what scale onboarding can look like at Figma and expand our programs to support international sales teams. You will collaborate with other members of the Customer Onboarding team to inform and evolve the processes and materials for this program. Also, you will use metrics, customer feedback and direct experience to help identify new initiatives and materials needed to better engage and support our customers. You are an excellent communicator and project manager with a passion for customers and we can&#39;t wait to meet you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a full time role based in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own and manage scale customer onboarding programs supporting a high volume of commercial customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner closely with sales, marketing and enablement teams to develop and evangelize the program within the Figma organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Guide customer goals and successfully drive a high volume of customers towards onboarding closeout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with Marketing, Operations and Sales to build and optimize scalable customer programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Report on metrics and customer feedback to assess the impact of successful onboarding and to help identify new customer initiatives and product opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop content and enablement resources for customers to use for training/education and to help accelerate product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Consult on product and industry best practices to act as a trusted advisor across a high-volume book of customers, inspiring new use cases for the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;4+ years of relevant work experience, ideally in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience managing customers through onboarding or implementation of technical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with many customers at one time and demonstrated ability to drive towards successful customer outcomes through many programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven time management and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated comfort speaking to customers representing different personas across both function and seniority, as well as building and leading wide scale customer webinars, in collaboration with marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it&#39;s not required, it&#39;s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience using or working with Figma, or other UX/UI experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You embody our values and can thrive in a constantly evolving and growing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven track record of adapting to new technologies and learning quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you&#39;re excited about this role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application limits:&lt;/strong&gt; To help candidates focus on the opportunities most relevant to their skills and experience, Figma limits the number and frequency of applications. These limits apply to all roles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may submit up to 5 applications during any rolling 30-day period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may not reapply to the same role while an application is active or within 90 days of receiving a rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once the applicable days has passed, candidates are welcome to apply again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raisin helps customers grow their wealth through savings and investments without barriers. But even the best products and the smoothest experience lose their value if customers pay more tax than they need to, or have to work out, declare and settle their taxes themselves. The Customer Taxation Team makes sure they don’t.&amp;nbsp; We design how tax works in Raisin’s tax-advantaged products, a growing part of our offer. Examples include the new Raisin Cash ISA in the UK and the Raisin Kinderdepot, a children’s investment account that uses the child’s tax allowances automatically. We also calculate and withhold tax on the interest and returns customers earn, handle their tax exemption orders and non-assessment certificates, and provide the annual tax documents they need for their tax return. And we send the tax reports that authorities require.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raisin is available in many European countries, each with its own tax rules and reporting duties. As new regulations come to our platform, we make sure Raisin complies. You will lead a cross-functional team and work closely with Legal, Compliance, Country Management, Product Operations, Customer Service, Data, and external tax and banking partners. Our goal is for customers to trust that their tax is right, find it easy to manage, use the tax allowances they are entitled to, and have peace of mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own a regulated domain that customers depend on every tax year. Working with an experienced Engineering Lead, you will become the go-to expert for customer taxation at Raisin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer taxation end to end: Define the vision and roadmap together with Product and Engineering leadership. Take each topic from discovery to delivery to measured impact. Decide what we build first, and keep stakeholders aligned on priorities, risks and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep tax accurate and reliable: Agree with Legal, Compliance and country managers on what correct looks like. Work with Engineering so calculation, documents and reporting stay stable and easy to extend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow Raisin’s tax proposition: Shape how tax works when Raisin enters new markets, launches tax-advantaged products or brings on new partners. Find where we can take tax work off customers’ hands, so they don’t have to declare and settle it themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex rules into simple experiences: Translate the &amp;nbsp;tax rules behind each launch into clear requirements with the edge cases covered. Design the customer experience and see the work through to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit the deadlines that cannot move: Make sure annual tax documents and statutory reports go out correct and on time, working with Product Operations. Plan backwards from fixed dates and monitor data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catch errors before they reach customers, and escalate early when a date is at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make tax effortless for customers: Keep self-service for tax exemption orders and non-assessment certificates intuitive, so customers get them right the first time. Give Customer Service the tools to answer tax questions fast, especially around tax season.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the team culture: Give and ask for feedback openly, share wins with the team, and treat mistakes as a reason to fix the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Must haves:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of product management experience, including ownership of a technical product such as a back-end, platform or data-heavy service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a cross-functional product team and getting engineers and stakeholders behind shared priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching new products or taking products into new markets, with the precision to get every edge case right, because one wrong tax rule can affect thousands of customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the habit of checking and reconciling numbers yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about tax and a drive to make it feel easy for customers, even when the rules behind it are not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to learn fast, take feedback well and change course when new facts come in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, a strong work ethic and a hands-on attitude to detailed work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured written English, and the confidence to explain trade-offs to senior leaders and say no with a reason.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated field such as banking, payments, insurance or tax technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the tax regime in one or more of Raisin’s markets, for example Germany (Abgeltungsteuer, tax exemption orders), or of statutory reporting such as CRS. Tax knowledge is not required. We will teach you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built tools for operations or customer service teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Important attributes for this role:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bridge product and engineering. You are comfortable discussing data models and architecture trade-offs, and you push for practical solutions that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Unframe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unframe is an AI-first startup helping the world’s largest enterprises bring LLM-powered applications to life in days - not months. We combine the speed of a product company with the flexibility of a consultancy, helping customers move from idea to deployed AI systems faster than anyone else in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Bessemer, Craft, and TLV Partners with $100M in Series B funding, we’re building a fast-growing, revenue-generating company working with Fortune 500 customers globally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits on the front line: you engage directly with enterprise clients, lead discovery to uncover core business challenges, and design and ship tailored AI solutions built on Unframe&#39;s platform. You own the work end-to-end, serving as the strategic and technical bridge from initial conversation through to final deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true builder role. You write the precise specifications and prompt architectures that bring solutions to life, making the critical design decisions that determine whether an enterprise AI deployment actually succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a project-led role with unmediated access to clients at every stage. You will typically manage several engagements simultaneously, with short planning horizons and evolving requirements. Roughly 30 to 40 percent of the role is active client management, ensuring senior stakeholders remain aligned through delivery, progress reviews, and post-deployment rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Enterprise Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct discovery sessions directly with enterprise clients to map workflows, uncover business challenges, and distinguish surface-level requests from fundamental operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Spec AI Solutions: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate customer problems into structured solution plans on Unframe&#39;s platform. Write detailed specs and define prompt and context structures, owning the complete solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive End-to-End Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with engineers and AI specialists to deliver solutions on target. Prioritize requirements and manage tradeoffs across speed, stability, and scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the User &amp;amp; Platform: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the voice of enterprise operators and domain experts while collaborating with the Platform team to identify reusable product patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in product management or technical delivery roles, with a proven track record working alongside engineering teams on complex, fast-paced technical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bilingual Fluency (English &amp;amp; French):&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in French to connect with users and stakeholders in France, and fluent in English for daily collaboration across our international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Led Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience personally leading consultative conversations with enterprise buyers and operators - not supporting a sales call, not interviewing platform users, but owning the conversation to surface unstated needs and translate them into clear solution scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to manage senior client relationships through a complex delivery; keeping stakeholders aligned, navigating competing priorities, and being the primary point of contact when requirements shift or timelines compress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-to-Solution Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to start from a raw business problem without existing features for reference, defining exactly how an AI solution should function and writing precise specs for build teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Delivery Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience shipping AI-powered features under tight timelines, managing evolving requirements, and documenting strategic tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Solutions Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct exposure to building with LLMs - writing prompt structures, defining context and output constraints, working with agentic systems, or managing model uncertainty in a shipped product or working prototype. This is the dimension most learnable on the job; concrete work product carries more weight than certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Orientation: &lt;/strong&gt;Driven by creating customer-facing solutions rather than simply managing traditional roadmaps or processing requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong written communication, systems thinking, high attention to detail, fluent English (written and verbal), and the ability to navigate multi-faceted projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Unframe, you’ll help build AI systems that are already delivering real value to global enterprises - not prototypes, demos, or side projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You’ll work with exceptional teammates, collaborate directly with top-tier customers, and have real influence over both the solutions we ship and the evolution of our platform. This is a hands-on, high-impact role where product thinking, technical depth, and creativity come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you enjoy solving hard problems, moving fast, and building practical AI products that actually make it to production - we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every Product Manager at Catawiki owns a meaningful part of the customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Search and Ranking, your mission is to help buyers find the special objects they care about. You will shape how search, ranking and personalisation work across the buyer journey, making discovery more relevant and helping more buyers find objects they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a broad product area. It brings together buyer needs, expert curation, marketplace priorities, search experiences and machine learning. You will identify the most important opportunities, set a clear direction and lead a cross functional team from insight to measurable customer and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The solution is not prescribed. You may improve search relevance, ranking, recommendations or personalisation, or explore new AI enabled ways to help buyers discover objects. What matters is that you solve a meaningful customer problem, measure the impact and scale what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the strategy, outcomes and execution for this area, working closely with Engineering, Design, Data Science, Marketing and Commercial teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and communicate a clear product vision, strategy and roadmap for Search and Ranking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own measurable outcomes across search relevance, discovery, engagement and buyer conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use behavioural data, customer research and commercial insight to identify and prioritise the biggest opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous customer and business problems into clear hypotheses, prototypes and executable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives from early discovery through experimentation, launch and scaling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics and build a rigorous experimentation agenda for search, ranking and personalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with machine learning engineers and data scientists to assess model quality, test new approaches and improve customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the relevance of search results and recommendations across the buyer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate personalisation into the customer experience in ways that feel useful, coherent and trustworthy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, run and evaluate experiments, using positive, negative and inconclusive results to guide decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI and rapid prototyping to test ideas early, reduce development risk and accelerate learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity, momentum and accountability across teams, including when priorities or incentives differ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate strategy, performance, tradeoffs and recommendations clearly to senior and C level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Three qualities matter most in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Outcome ownership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take responsibility for customer and business results, not only for delivering features. You stay with the problem, remove obstacles and change direction when the evidence calls for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Systems thinking&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand how search, ranking, recommendations, auction dynamics, expert curation and marketplace health influence one another. You make thoughtful decisions across the full buyer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experimental rigour&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You use data, research, prototypes and controlled experiments to make decisions. You learn from negative results and can distinguish meaningful progress from activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least five years of product management experience, preferably in consumer ecommerce, marketplaces or another digital product at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a broad product area or customer journey, rather than only individual features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining product strategy or roadmaps for search, ranking, recommendations, personalisation or other machine learning products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with product metrics, experiments and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, running and analysing A/B tests, including tests involving machine learning products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to turn uncertain opportunities into clear hypotheses, prototypes and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of machine learning concepts and how models become useful product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with machine learning engineers and data scientists to develop and improve customer facing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI tools to prototype quickly and explore customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance immediate commercial opportunities with longer term product and platform investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and the ability to influence senior leaders without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The pace, resilience and judgement to maintain a high standard of execution in an ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Amsterdam. We offer a relocation package for people currently living outside the Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for Product Managers to join Vinted Marketplace within our Security domain. The Security domain protects member accounts and keeps the platform safe by securing sign-up and login for both individuals and businesses. We prevent fake or malicious registrations and automated bot activity, manage email/phone verification and two-factor authentication, reduce account takeovers, detect inappropriate multiple-account use, and build the core systems that power identity, verification, and additional security checks when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your experience and interests, you will join one of three teams tackling meaningful problems for our business and members:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multiple Accounts: &lt;/strong&gt;Shape how multiple accounts and profiles work on Vinted, with an immediate priority on creating a safe, easy-to-use experience for minors and teens (including parental controls, compliance, and safety mechanisms), while expanding support for broader usage patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Registration: &lt;/strong&gt;Protect genuine users while preventing malicious actors, focusing on end-to-end registration flows, UX-first adaptive registration, and defense mechanisms against bot activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verification: &lt;/strong&gt;Own email/phone verification (2FA), identity check mechanisms, and friction platforms, ensuring seamless, scalable verification for genuine members while stopping compromised or fake accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In close partnership with teams across your domain and neighboring areas, you’ll collaborate with Product Design, Product Analytics, Engineering, and cross-functional leadership to drive real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and align the vision, product strategy, and measurable OKRs for your ownership area, connecting member problems to business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct rigorous product discovery, framing complex member, safety, security, and business problems using both qualitative research and quantitative analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering, Design, Data, Research, Legal, Compliance, Operations, Member Support, and external 3rd-party vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand end-to-end user journeys, technical architecture constraints, safety signals, and platform ecosystem dynamics for both genuine users and malicious actors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the product development cycle using agile methodologies, making clear trade-offs, managing roadmaps, running hypothesis-based experiments (A/B testing), and iterating based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure regulatory, legal, and security requirements are integrated into product decisions from the start without compromising a smooth member journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring clarity to ambiguous problem spaces and communicate effectively across technical and non-technical stakeholders and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of product management experience in a fast-paced, cross-functional tech environment, with a track record across the full product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience or strong interest in Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Security, Registration/Onboarding, Bot Detection, Identity, Parental Controls, Compliance, or Fraud/Abuse Prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong self-starter who thrives in ambiguous environments, bringing structure, defining scope, and translating complex concepts into actionable product steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply member-centric with an analytical mindset, skilled at using qualitative insights and quantitative data to make product decisions, track metrics, and evaluate A/B tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable understanding technical architecture and infrastructure constraints; hands-on and willing to dig into details to unblock execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communicator who can bridge technical, design, legal, and operational conversations to align stakeholders and influence priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€73.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€98.900 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are seeking a results-driven Senior Product Manager / Product Manager to own key commercial and technical areas of Verve&#39;s core programmatic Marketplace.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you will lead cross-functional product execution alongside Engineering, Yield, Commercial, and Operations teams, driving measurable improvements in marketplace performance, publisher yield, and DSP spend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your background and expertise, you will take ownership of one of our core exchange areas, including mobile and in-app advertising, SDK integrations, CTV, video, or web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own feature discovery, product requirements (PRDs), user stories, and clearly defined acceptance criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prioritize product backlogs based on revenue impact, margin protection, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Tech Leads, Engineering Managers, Commercial, and Yield teams to align product priorities with business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive improvements across core exchange capabilities, publisher monetization, and platform integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor exchange KPIs to identify revenue challenges, feature issues, and new growth opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead product releases across cross-functional teams, ensuring clear documentation, stakeholder alignment, and communication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2+ years (Product Manager) or 4+ years (Senior Product Manager) of hands-on product management experience in programmatic advertising, including SSPs, Ad Exchanges, DSPs, or Ad Servers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of OpenRTB protocols, RTB auction mechanics, supply chain transparency, and digital advertising formats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with programmatic exchanges and a solid understanding of the supply side of the advertising ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work closely with Engineering teams on technical products, platform capabilities, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with structured prioritization frameworks (e.g., RICE) and Agile development methodologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to translate marketplace performance metrics into product improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with mobile app monetization, advertising SDKs, CTV, video or web advertising technologies, or publisher integrations is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with 3 &lt;strong&gt;Wellness Days &lt;/strong&gt;throughout the year, in addition to your annual vacation and public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental well-being with our &lt;strong&gt;Workplace Mental Health Solution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual &lt;strong&gt;training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars&lt;/strong&gt;, and level up your language skills through our &lt;strong&gt;German/English classes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen team connections while exploring new cultures through our monthly &lt;strong&gt;Work&amp;amp;Travel raffle,&lt;/strong&gt; offering a chance to work from one of our global offices (after 2 years of employment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristol, UK &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date: &lt;/strong&gt;September 2027&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application deadline&lt;/strong&gt;: Midnight, 29th November 2026&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage you to apply early, as we may close applications before the advertised deadline.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Graduate Programme at Graphcore&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Graphcore in a permanent role and start your career with two years of hands-on learning. From day one, you’ll be trusted to take ownership, share your ideas and help shape what we’re creating. You’ll tackle challenging problems alongside a team who support your development and are as excited about your success as you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/sUqy-WuXPsE&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll work on&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Put your design skills to work on clearer ways for people to understand complex AI workloads.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In Graphcore’s UX team, you’ll help shape software used to understand and optimise workloads running on our hardware. Your work will make technical workflows easier to navigate and turn complex system behaviour into clear user experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With support from senior designers, you’ll create wireframes, high-fidelity designs and research materials. You’ll also help run usability studies, analyse findings and maintain our research repository, using what you learn to improve designs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your team and support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The UX team works closely with engineers and product managers throughout the development lifecycle. Design decisions are shaped by user insight, technical constraints and clear evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your manager, Lucy, will work with you to build your skills, make time for learning and shape your career. Her favourite part of leadership is helping talented, driven people turn ideas into action, with the support and space to do their best work. You’ll also have a buddy to help you settle in, alongside a team of experienced designers keen to share what they know and help you develop.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Josh recently joined us as a graduate and is confident, he’ll have discovered all the best lunch spots near the office by the time you arrive. He’s looking forward to sharing his favourites with you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You’ll contribute to Decagon, our design library, and help keep research insights useful and easy to find. The work moves from discovery to design, testing and iteration, and you will build confidence and take ownership of defined tasks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You’ll be encouraged to ask questions, challenge existing approaches and share ideas for making things better. We’ll support you to take responsibility for your work and speak up when you spot a problem or need help. Thoughtful discussion and clear communication help us learn from each other and improve our designs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;How you’ll learn and grow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;During the two-year programme, you’ll build skills across user experience (UX), user interface (UI) design, research and design systems through real product work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Creating designs and helping run usability studies will give you practical experience of exploring user needs, testing ideas and turning findings into improvements. Contributing to Decagon will help you understand how a shared design library supports consistent interfaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Working with senior designers, engineers and product managers will help you explain your design decisions, respond to feedback and understand how user needs and technical constraints shape a product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A degree in UX, Interaction Design, Human–Computer Interaction (HCI), Graphic Design or a related discipline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;UX/UI design experience and a portfolio demonstrating your UX thinking, design process and visual skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proficiency in design tools such as Figma or Adobe XD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with an interest in designing for complex, technical or business-to-business (B2B) software products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your experience can come from academic or personal projects, internships or placements. In your portfolio, show the problem you explored, how you approached it, the design decisions you made and what you learned.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electric Vehicle Scheme: Choose an electric vehicle and lease it through salary sacrifice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Sponsorship&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must already have the right to work in the UK for the full duration of the programme, without requiring visa sponsorship. We are unable to sponsor work visas for our Early Careers opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Introduction to Graphcore&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Graphcore, we’re building next generation AI compute: from semiconductors and software to systems at datacenter scale. We are proud to be owned by SoftBank Group and work with other companies in the SoftBank family to deliver AI compute to customers working at the AI frontier.&amp;nbsp;Starting your career here means working alongside people with different backgrounds and expertise, from AI researchers to chip designers and software engineers. You’ll learn from each other, bring fresh ideas and help solve challenging problems together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How to apply and what to expect&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To apply, answer the application questions below and upload your CV and cover letter. We’ll let you know the outcome of your application by early December at the latest. If successful, you’ll be invited to complete a technical assessment. Candidates who reach the final stage will then be invited to attend in-person assessments in early spring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW27105366 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27105366 BCX0&quot;&gt;Ready to put your learning into practice? Start your UX career in a permanent role, with two years of hands-on learning through the Graphcore Graduate Programme. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW27105366 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27105366 BCX0&quot;&gt;Apply now and help shape what comes next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW27105366 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

