&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workwize&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workwize helps companies equip their remote and global teams with IT equipment. Our SaaS platform takes care of buying, delivering, managing and returning laptops and other devices in more than 100 countries. Today more than 50,000 users and 120,000 devices are managed through Workwize.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the team that builds the systems behind our finance and internal operations. That means billing, invoicing and the internal tools our Operations and Finance teams use every day. The team is small but has a big impact. Mistakes here are expensive, so quality and good judgement matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You lead the engineers, work closely with the team&#39;s Product Manager and report to the Engineering Manager. You also work directly with senior leadership. You own the people, the way the team works and the delivery of the roadmap. You stay close to the code: about 30 to 40% of your time goes to code reviews, technical design and some hands-on work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow your engineers through 1:1s, clear feedback and growth plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear bar for performance, and act early when someone is not meeting it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery of the team&#39;s roadmap and keep progress, risks and blockers visible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the roadmap and quarterly goals with Product, Operations and Finance, including what we say no to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run planning, refinement and retros, and represent the team in talks with other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep standards high on code review, testing, monitoring, security and incident follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire new engineers for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set good habits for using AI tools in development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years as a software engineer, including at least 1 to 2 years managing engineers with direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling performance issues: setting expectations, giving hard feedback and supporting someone who is struggling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership style that can switch between directing and coaching, depending on the situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to explain and defend your point of view to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a modern web stack. We use Laravel (PHP), Node.js, React, Filament and MySQL. You don&#39;t need to know all of them, because strong engineers learn them fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering B2B web products end to end, working with non-technical colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily use of AI tools in your development work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and spoken English (Dutch is not needed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in FinTech, or with finance and billing systems (invoicing, order-to-cash, tax, or accounting and ERP integrations like Exact or QuickBooks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Laravel Filament or other admin panel tools, or moving internal tools off low-code platforms like Retool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building LLM features or AI agents for internal operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale-up experience, ideally in B2B SaaS, logistics or operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the Netherlands: hybrid, 2 to 3 days a week in our Amsterdam office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elsewhere in EMEA: remote, with working hours that overlap with CET and occasional visits to Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short video interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team fit interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study: two short role-play scenarios with the panel. You don&#39;t need to prepare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top tools and equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial culture with room to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Off-sites and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team lunches and surprise events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass corporate membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This position brings together a defined set of responsibilities into a single point of coordination, ensuring the team continues to respond effectively to commercial and trade priorities across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role acts as the connective layer across marketing channels: building visibility on what each channel owner is delivering, translating trade and commercial priorities into marketing action, and representing Global Marketing in trade conversations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a newly created, fixed-term role designed to provide focused trade and commercial marketing support to the Global Marketing team during a period of maternity leave cover. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Trade &amp;amp; Commercial Marketing Coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Represent Global Marketing at trade meetings, feeding commercial business priorities back into the marketing team and translating them into appropriate marketing actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as the central point of visibility across all marketing channels — working with each channel owner to understand current activity, upcoming plans and performance, so the wider business has a clear, single view of what&#39;s happening to support trade and commercial needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:504,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide a first point of contact for the business on marketing-related trade queries, escalating and prioritising as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Operations Marketing (F&amp;amp;B)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as the global point of contact for Operations marketing, supporting F&amp;amp;B initiatives designed to maximise revenue and footfall across Soho Houses globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with House and Operations teams to shape marketing support for commercial trading priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bedrooms Marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work closely with the global Bedrooms team on the commercial and brand marketing plan, covering both long-term positioning and short-term tactical activity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage Google paid channels for Soho House bedrooms, including Metasearch, Performance Max (PMax) and Demand Gen campaigns, optimising spend and performance against commercial targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Web &amp;amp; SEO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Oversee Web and SEO projects on sohohouse.com, with a particular focus on optimising membership acquisition and application journeys.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with digital and web teams to prioritise projects that improve conversion through the membership funnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Performance Insight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Interpret and quantify data to report on performance across marketing channels, translating results into clear, actionable insight for the wider team and business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Maintain consistent reporting rhythms so channel performance is easy to track and communicate across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:504,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
