&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core skills: &lt;/strong&gt;business development, new logo acquisition, strategic account management, cross-sell, video infrastructure, executive engagement, pipeline generation, enterprise closing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bitmovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;is an award-winning video streaming technology to world-renowned brands and managed service providers. Our solution suite consists of Live and VOD Encoding, a Multi-Platform Player, and Analytics platform; enabling content owners to redefine the viewer experience through API-based workflow optimization, fast turnaround, and scalability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have seen great success and created great momentum in the market. This is down to our products, ecosystem, but ultimately our people who love video streaming and helping customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;“We’re building the future of video streaming across EMEA - combining high-impact hunting with strategic account growth to deliver unmatched commercial results. If you’re ready to help shape the industry and make a real impact, join us.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Barney Withers Green, SVP, Sales &amp;amp; Business Development, EMEA &amp;amp; APAC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;Bitmovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we value cognitive diversity and the huge part this plays in not only creating a global culture second to none, but in how this underpins our ability to create truly representative, Emmy award winning products. Diversity in all its forms is encouraged and celebrated at Bitmovin; everyone has a role to play in helping us shape the future of video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why us?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bitmovin&lt;/strong&gt; is rapidly growing with significant market opportunity, and we are looking for talented and self driven individuals to take Bitmovin to the next level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Following an exciting evolution of our commercial structure, we are seeking an exceptional, commercially driven Sales Director to accelerate revenue growth, develop strategic opportunities, and strengthen our presence across key EMEA markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role uniquely combines high-impact new business development with strategic ownership of key customer relationships. Supported by designated Account Managers and Customer Success resources for day-to-day management, you will be empowered to focus on winning new logos, driving strategic cross-sell, and engaging executives across the region. With our full support and coaching, you will pave your own path, collaborating with our global teams to shape the future of media and streaming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity that offers:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to shape the streaming and video technology strategies of leading EMEA Media &amp;amp; Entertainment companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid role balancing high-velocity new business acquisition with strategic key account ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling market-leading products (Live Encoding, VOD Encoding, Player, Observability) alongside top Cloud Partners and System Integrators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy, international collaboration, flexible working, and regional travel (~50%).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director, Sales &amp;amp; Key Accounts, you will be at the forefront of powering the next generation of digital video across EMEA. Your mission is to fuel Bitmovin’s expansion by acquiring game-changing new logos and driving high-value strategic growth across priority markets, including the UK, DACH, and selected CEE &amp;amp; MENA regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating within the global GTM and partner strategy to define and execute local initiatives in media, streaming, and OTT markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving direct enterprise sales with full sales cycle ownership, including multi-year SaaS agreements and platform licensing deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling customers to adopt Bitmovin solutions in the way that best fits their business — direct, partner-led, or cloud/video platform routes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying, onboarding, and enabling local partners to drive net-new revenue and new customer wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with local and global teams (solutions engineering, customer success, partner teams) to support adoption and partner success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing market insights, competitor intelligence, and recommendations on product, pricing, and GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking pipeline, revenue, and partner acquisition KPIs to measure impact and improve conversion rates across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What competencies can you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven success selling software/technology into broadcasters, OTT platforms, or video infrastructure (CDN, adtech, broadcast tech)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Accountability: &lt;/strong&gt;Track record of originating, closing complex enterprise sales, and consistently exceeding revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Established network of technical and commercial decision-makers across EMEA media and streaming ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen: &lt;/strong&gt;Solid grasp of streaming workflows, technical ecosystems, and enterprise buying processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Self-driven, highly autonomous pipeline builder focused on results and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Influence: &lt;/strong&gt;Confident navigating high-value negotiations and engaging senior executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Adaptability: &lt;/strong&gt;Open to feedback and skilled at partnering across cross-functional teams to drive collective success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 6 Months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong relationships with priority customers, prospects, and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a clear territory plan and strategic business development roadmaps for target regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a healthy, self-generated pipeline of qualified opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and progress strategic cross-sell opportunities within assigned key accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 12 Months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver against agreed net-new ARR and strategic cross-sell targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate consistent pipeline generation and enterprise deal progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish meaningful new customer relationships across priority EMEA markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong executive engagement and strategic oversight of assigned key accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate independently with rigorous forecasting discipline and commercial accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t have experience with all the points above? Don’t worry, we will support you with learning, training, and coaching on the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Bitmovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about us on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://bitmovin.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Careers Page&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;See what fellow Bitmovers are saying on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/bitmovin/life/7f143265-8cc2-4ae8-93f4-dc88cf00d0d4/?viewAsMember=true&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Check the employee reviews on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.co.uk/Reviews/Bitmovin-Reviews-E1400248.htm&quot;&gt; Glassdoor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For all of our roles, we are willing to discuss flexible working arrangements to support everyone’s unique circumstances.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Phiture&#39;s CRM &amp;amp; Retention team as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior CRM Consultant, covering maternity &lt;/strong&gt;leave for one of our most senior consultants on our &lt;strong&gt;flagship HBO Max account&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll lead high-impact CRM and lifecycle marketing programs for one of our largest and most technically demanding clients, working across EMEA (and APAC). This is a hands-on role combining deep technical Braze expertise with senior-level client relationship ownership — you&#39;ll be the primary point of contact for key stakeholders, responsible for maintaining the trust and quality bar this account has built over several years, including award-winning campaign work (Braze Torchie Awards, People&#39;s Choice Award for CRM Campaign of the Year).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a fixed-term engagement (approx. 5 to 12 months) starting mid-November to early December, allowing sufficient time to onboard and shadow before full handover.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Day-to-Day Client Relationship&lt;/strong&gt;: Act as the senior point of contact for our client stakeholders, maintaining the level of trust, responsiveness, and strategic input the account is known for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead CRM Technical Architecture &amp;amp; Audits&lt;/strong&gt;: Conduct advanced audits of CRM setups, including taxonomy, event structure, API integrations, custom attributes, and webhook flows, ensuring accurate data flows and scalable architecture within Braze.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maximize Braze Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;: Deeply leverage Braze&#39;s advanced personalization and automation capabilities such as custom events, real-time triggers, Liquid logic, and dynamic content to maintain and evolve our clients’ lifecycle programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Lifecycle Campaign Execution&lt;/strong&gt;: Own planning and execution of end-to-end lifecycle marketing strategies across channels (email, push, in-app, SMS), aligned to HBO Max&#39;s user journeys and business goals, including large-scale, high-profile campaigns (e.g. major content launches, live events).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate closely with Creative, Retention, Martech, and CRM Ops counterparts (both Phiture-side and client-side) to keep campaigns aligned and delivered on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Integrity &amp;amp; Technical Troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with client dev/data teams to validate event instrumentation, user segmentation logic, and troubleshoot CRM workflows, APIs, and marketing data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Experimentation&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and implement A/B and multivariate tests across channels to optimize lifecycle touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze &amp;amp; Report on Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate retention/engagement KPIs and cohort behavior (via Amplitude, Mixpanel, or Looker) into clear, actionable insights and recommendations for both internal team and client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach where needed&lt;/strong&gt;: Support and mentor any freelance or junior support resources allocated to the account during the engagement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in CRM&lt;/strong&gt;, lifecycle marketing, or marketing automation, ideally for large-scale mobile/streaming or subscription products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise with Braze specifically&lt;/strong&gt; - API usage, Liquid logic, webhook setups, custom events/attributes, and advanced campaign architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable performing technical audits&lt;/strong&gt; and working directly with client product/data teams on taxonomy, tracking plans, and event schemas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong data literacy&lt;/strong&gt;: able to query and interpret data, build dashboards, and translate findings into recommendations, using tools like Amplitude, Mixpanel, Looker, or Tableau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience owning senior-level client relationships independently&lt;/strong&gt; - this role requires stepping into an established, high-trust relationship with minimal ramp-up support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding of retention/engagement mechanics&lt;/strong&gt; for large consumer/subscription products, including behavioral triggers, cohort segmentation, and monetization models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficient with HTML&lt;/strong&gt; for messaging templates and troubleshooting cross-device layout issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent client communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and confidence leading client workshops, meetings, and audits independently, including with senior client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/strong&gt; (verbal and written).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available to start mid-November to early December&lt;/strong&gt;, for a fixed-term engagement of approximately&lt;strong&gt; 5-6 months&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with entertainment/streaming or subscription-based media clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with multi-market/multi-region CRM programs (EMEA + APAC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation design and testing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in agile squads or cross-functional pods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ASO and performance marketing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work&lt;/strong&gt; — Unlimited remote work within your home country (EMEA), plus up to 90 days per year internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Vacation Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy up to 30 days of paid vacation annually, plus extra days for special occasions (country-specific), so you can recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quarterly Bonus Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; — Boost your earnings through our quarterly bonus scheme, directly linked to our shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellness Prioritized&lt;/strong&gt; — Free, confidential mental health support from licensed therapists through our partnership with Oliva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development Investment&lt;/strong&gt; — €1,000 annual personal growth budget and 10 dedicated learning hours each month, empowering your continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/strong&gt; — Shape your workday around your lifestyle and productivity, choosing working patterns that best suit you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vibrant Berlin Office&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy a flexible, pet-friendly workspace at our spacious headquarters located in one of Berlin’s most vibrant neighborhoods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Team Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Regular team-building events and a memorable annual all-expenses-paid company offsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; — A personalized career roadmap and development plan designed to keep you advancing professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Monthly remote-work cash allowance to level up your home workspace or help cover internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Onboarding Kit&lt;/strong&gt; — Branded Phiture gear and your very own MacBook from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Celebrations &lt;/strong&gt;— Responsibly sourced birthday, anniversary, and seasonal gifts, because every milestone deserves recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Staff Software Engineer: Applied AI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day, thousands of shipments cross borders, change hands, and hit unexpected problems. For decades, fixing those problems meant phone calls, emails, and humans heroically firefighting. We think that&#39;s about to change completely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve been building AI agents that spot trouble before it happens, reroute shipments, and keep goods moving—with our team of experts in the loop where it counts. The early results have been jaw-dropping. We&#39;re now going all in on a future where supply chains run themselves, and we&#39;re looking for the people who want to build that future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role where you join a team and pick up tickets. You&#39;ll find the highest-leverage problems, design the solutions, and ship them to operators moving freight across 112 countries. If that sounds like your idea of a good time, read on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build the cutting-edge agents and AI-powered applications that make Flexport&#39;s operations smarter, faster, and increasingly autonomous. That means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and shipping &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end AI agents&lt;/strong&gt; that handle real logistics work—customs compliance, document processing, exception management, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crossing organizational boundaries&lt;/strong&gt; to understand problems deeply, align stakeholders, and get things done without waiting for permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moving fast from idea to production, treating every deployment as a learning opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with operators, domain experts, and leadership to turn ambiguous problems into shipped solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Should Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;; you&#39;ve built with LLMs extensively — whether in production, side projects, or just because you couldn&#39;t stop yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product instincts&lt;/strong&gt;: you can identify what&#39;s worth building, not just execute on a spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: agent patterns, RAG, prompt engineering, tool use, evaluation. You know what works in production and what looks good in demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack capability&lt;/strong&gt; in TypeScript and Next.js—you can own a feature end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial drive&lt;/strong&gt;: you thrive in ambiguity, move fast, and don&#39;t wait to be told what to do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication&lt;/strong&gt;: you can work across teams and disciplines to get alignment and unblock yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An audacious appetite for impact&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;re not here to maintain—you&#39;re here to change how global trade works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow orchestration (Temporal, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tools or operator-facing applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We come to the office 3 times a week to hang out, whiteboard, and ship together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have the latest hardware and software—including frontier AI models on day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re agile, but not dogmatic. Teams decide how they work best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack&lt;/strong&gt;: Next.js, TypeScript, Postgres, Snowflake. For AI: Anthropic, OpenAI, Google AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Role Is Special&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your work is visible&lt;/strong&gt;: This is a small, senior team reporting directly to the VP of Engineering. What you build gets noticed, and your ideas shape the direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real stakes&lt;/strong&gt;: thousands of containers, 112 countries, $19 billion of goods. Your agents will have immediate, measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: from problem definition to production deployment, it&#39;s yours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re early&lt;/strong&gt;: the playbook for applied AI in enterprise logistics doesn&#39;t exist yet—you&#39;ll help write it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunches incl. vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and soft drinks available in our office on daily basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute expenses: Flexport will cover&amp;nbsp; home-office commuting costs for employees living outside of Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers a collective health insurance plan including a basic package and any available additional packages. Your monthly premium is fully paid by Flexport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined pension contribution scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot;&gt;
